math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the starting vertex for the DFS traversal.</li></ul><p data-ref="606bef5c-5aca-4582-a1ff-94ef81db2dc1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="20bb7002-fe73-4fed-a922-8d93d665e34b"></p><p data-ref="a248d976-9102-4e6b-a883-bc79cc63ccfc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="6d184d29-50de-45b3-bfb4-bce69fb0bc1f">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="2d67e24d-a6e8-4745-a1dc-d1251824be9c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="ad76112f-1876-420e-a924-1ae835f7dbe7">Print the DFS traversal of the graph starting from <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.7%; position: relative;" data-ref="4d13d87a-0689-452c-b196-fd3a9b94ae93" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="7801e6f0-7169-4e7b-afae-3a900edf21d2"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="5207c2af-b960-413a-88f1-89f8236a7afc"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D446 TEX-I" data-ref="551cf7a2-360c-4f44-ba62-24c4ea707173"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="057b078a-85e2-440e-b406-6504bee7581b"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="ad253312-181a-4c7e-b10a-6692548ebdb2"><mi data-ref="538d640b-97c3-4e5a-9f67-68b829951b84">S</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, with vertices separated by a space.</li></ul><p data-ref="b02e061f-3f28-48dd-ad75-f2605d3b8130" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="de82cef4-779d-46b7-aa2a-16d73644662c"></p><p data-ref="6b8a34bd-77d7-4ee1-8208-e9049c95cfb6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="920614d9-af58-402e-81f0-95e6cc5c5a3b">Note:</strong></p><ul data-ref="a9f06afd-dc63-4497-8244-88887dab0538" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="0cb57c74-19ce-4150-9883-16cc1f2530a9">If multiple nodes are available to visit, DFS should proceed in the order of their appearance in the adjacency matrix.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="37156419-1b2b-469c-984e-657212ed680b"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="33d9ceb5-e780-4944-9de9-b60215516316"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="d3a3319d-4c8a-4325-babd-88eb336d3ea1" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="78d9843b-35b0-4d9a-b3f6-0a6deeebd38d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="fcf5e082-f14e-4743-833e-f0c61d054e59" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">CTC64641.c</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="8495c6f7-fb00-461b-97ef-24bf798cc703" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;
#define MAX 10
int adj[MAX][MAX]; // adjacency matrix
int visited[MAX];
int stack[MAX];
int top = -1;
int n; // number of vertices
void push(int v) {
    stack[++top] = v;
}
int pop() {
    return stack[top--];
}
int isEmpty() {
    return (top == -1);
}
void dfs_stack(int start) {
    push(start);
    visited[start] = 1; // mark early

    while (!isEmpty()) {
        int current = pop();
        printf("%d ", current);
        for (int i = n ; i &gt;= 0; i--) {
            if (adj[current][i] == 1 &amp;&amp; !visited[i]) {
                push(i);
                visited[i] = 1; // mark here to avoid duplicate pushes
            }
        }
    }
}
int main() {
    int edges, u, v, start;
    // Input vertices and edges
    scanf("%d", &amp;n);
    scanf("%d", &amp;edges);
    // Initialize adjacency matrix and visited array
    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {
        visited[i] = 0;
        for (int j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {
            adj[i][j] = 0;
        }
    }
    // Read edges
    for (int i = 0; i &lt; edges; i++) {
        scanf("%d %d", &amp;u, &amp;v);
        adj[u][v] = 1;
        adj[v][u] = 1; // undirected graph
    }
    // Read starting vertex
    scanf("%d", &amp;start);
    // DFS traversal using stack
    dfs_stack(start);
    return 0;
}


