;" data-ref="896edc7a-f979-4379-ae6a-d00f6f2d09a2" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="0af6c82b-d3b6-441d-80b2-17f6e322e7ba"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="ac13ac21-0f34-4787-a838-c2e0a8260d80"><p data-ref="10ca9755-67f9-4e87-8500-7a4cc2d526e7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to implement a Min Heap of integers. The program should first read a list of integers and insert them into the heap while maintaining the min-heap property. It should then read the number of deletions to perform, delete the root (minimum element) that many times, and display the heap both before and after the deletions.</p><p data-ref="ca70d968-52a7-4363-b21a-58fdb1f7d343" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="45b150c5-06e6-4106-a128-a2ed280208ee"></p><p data-ref="e6670346-fe5e-4e75-990a-7048eb66bfb7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="2374550e-9ce9-466a-bc38-13d04897705b">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="f3566d2d-2205-4225-92d3-b65651dac4ba" data-counter-list-1-rese